Pre-generated PMS class catalog lives in this directory.

Each file is named `{class_code}.json` (e.g. A1.json, F1N.json, T80A.json)
and contains the full PMS body the AI used to generate per request — pipe
data, fittings, flange, valves, notes, etc.

Generated by `scripts/generate_class_catalog.py`. Read by
`app/services/class_catalog.py:lookup_pms()`.
